  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BiH Press Council</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Pressr&#xE5;d Bosnien</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det bosniska pressr&#xE5;det &#xE4;r ett organ som skall kontrollera pressen i landet i stil med den svenske Pressombudsmannen resp. Pressens Opinionsn&#xE4;mnd. Pressr&#xE5;det &#xE4;r en lokal institution, st&#xF6;dd av det internationella samfundet, och baserar sitt arbete p&#xE5; frivillighet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The BiH Press Council is a body which shall regulate the press in the country in a similar way as the Swedish Press Ombudsman. The Press Council is a local institution, supported by the international community, and bases its regulatory work on voluntary corrective action.</narrative>
  </description>
